Object.assign(I18N.langs.en.dict,{"Transfusiones por peso": "Transfusions by weight", "Glóbulos rojos, plaquetas, plasma y crioprecipitado · adicional, no figura en ARUCIP": "Red cells, platelets, plasma and cryoprecipitate · additional, not in ARUCIP", "Adicional: no figura en ARUCIP. Volúmenes y umbrales por componente. Verificá siempre las dosis con la guía y el criterio clínico.": "Additional: not in ARUCIP. Volumes and thresholds by component. Always verify doses against the guideline and clinical judgment.", "Glóbulos rojos": "Red blood cells", "Volumen, {0} a {1} mL/kg": "Volume, {0} to {1} mL/kg", "{0} unidad, cerca de {1} mL": "{0} unit, about {1} mL", "{0} a {1} mL": "{0} to {1} mL", "Velocidad, {0} mL/kg/h (máx {1} mL/h)": "Rate, {0} mL/kg/h (max {1} mL/h)", "Más de {0} kg: {1} unidad y reevaluar. {2} mL/kg suben cerca de {3} g/dL. Terminá en menos de {4} horas. En sangrado crítico, tan rápido como haga falta.": "Over {0} kg: {1} unit and reassess. {2} mL/kg raises Hb by about {3} g/dL. Finish within {4} hours. In critical bleeding, as fast as needed.", "Hb menor de {0} g/dL sin síntomas: transfundir.": "Hb below {0} g/dL without symptoms: transfuse.", "Hb de {0} a {1} g/dL: solo con signos de oferta de oxígeno insuficiente.": "Hb {0} to {1} g/dL: only with signs of inadequate oxygen delivery.", "Hb de {0} g/dL o más: inapropiado salvo causa documentada.": "Hb {0} g/dL or more: inappropriate unless a cause is documented.", "⚠ Discrepancia: umbrales de la GAP Garrahan {0} frente a Hb {1} g/dL o menos en UCIP estable, {2} g/dL en lesión cerebral grave y {3} g/dL en cardiopatía cianótica o ECMO (Versiti {4}). Sin umbral único en neonatos.": "⚠ Discrepancy: Garrahan GAP {0} thresholds versus Hb {1} g/dL or less in stable PICU patients, {2} g/dL in severe brain injury and {3} g/dL in cyanotic heart disease or ECMO (Versiti {4}). No single threshold in neonates.", "⚠ Discrepancia: TAXI {0} y SSC niños {1}: no transfundir con Hb de {2} g/dL o más si está hemodinámicamente estable. En shock séptico sin sangrado, SSC {3} sugiere evitar plaquetas y plasma profilácticos.": "⚠ Discrepancy: TAXI {0} and SSC children {1}: do not transfuse with Hb {2} g/dL or more if hemodynamically stable. In septic shock without bleeding, SSC {3} suggests avoiding prophylactic platelets and plasma.", "Plaquetas": "Platelets", "Volumen, {0} mL/kg ({1} kg o más: {2} unidad)": "Volume, {0} mL/kg ({1} kg or more: {2} unit)", "{0} unidad": "{0} unit", "Velocidad, {0} a {1} mL/kg/h": "Rate, {0} to {1} mL/kg/h", "Sube cerca de {0} a {1}/µL. Respetá el grupo ABO si se puede.": "Raises the count by about {0} to {1}/µL. Respect ABO group when possible.", "Profilaxis: {0}/µL en insuficiencia medular, quimioterapia y trasplante; {1}/µL en ciertos tumores sólidos.": "Prophylaxis: {0}/µL in marrow failure, chemotherapy and transplant; {1}/µL in certain solid tumors.", "Sangrado activo por consumo o secuestro: mantener {0}/µL o más.": "Active bleeding from consumption or sequestration: keep {0}/µL or more.", "Neurocirugía: {0}/µL o más.": "Neurosurgery: {0}/µL or more.", "Biopsia hepática, bypass y cirugía mayor en leucemia: {0}/µL o más.": "Liver biopsy, bypass and major surgery in leukemia: {0}/µL or more.", "Catéter central y endoscopía: {0}/µL o más. Fibrobroncoscopía: {1}/µL o más.": "Central line and endoscopy: {0}/µL or more. Bronchoscopy: {1}/µL or more.", "Púrpura trombótica trombocitopénica: contraindicadas salvo hemorragia que amenace la vida.": "Thrombotic thrombocytopenic purpura: contraindicated except for life-threatening hemorrhage.", "⚠ Discrepancia: profilaxis {0}/µL (GAP {1}) frente a {2}/µL y {3}/µL en críticos (Versiti {4}). Volumen: {5} mL/kg (GAP {6} en neonatos, RCH {7}) frente a {8} a {9} mL/kg en menores de {10} meses y fracciones de unidad por peso (Versiti {11}).": "⚠ Discrepancy: prophylaxis {0}/µL (GAP {1}) versus {2}/µL and {3}/µL in critically ill patients (Versiti {4}). Volume: {5} mL/kg (GAP {6} in neonates, RCH {7}) versus {8} to {9} mL/kg under {10} months and unit fractions by weight (Versiti {11}).", "Plasma fresco congelado": "Fresh frozen plasma", "CID en paciente crítico, {0} mL/kg": "DIC in a critically ill patient, {0} mL/kg", "Indicado: anticoagulantes orales con sangrado grave, hepatopatía grave antes de procedimientos, cirugía cardíaca con sangrado y RIN alterado, déficit aislado sin concentrado, PTT.": "Indicated: oral anticoagulants with severe bleeding, severe liver disease before procedures, cardiac surgery with bleeding and abnormal INR, isolated deficiency without a concentrate, TTP.", "No indicado: profilaxis en CID o cirugía cardíaca, RIN prolongado sin sangrado, reemplazo de volumen, aporte de proteínas.": "Not indicated: prophylaxis in DIC or cardiac surgery, prolonged INR without bleeding, volume replacement, protein supply.", "Grupo: primero el mismo; luego AB. No uses plasma O en otros grupos salvo situación crítica.": "Group: same group first, then AB. Do not use O plasma in other groups except in a critical situation.", "⚠ Discrepancia: {0} a {1} mL/kg (GAP {2}) frente a {3} a {4} mL/kg (RCH {5}, Versiti {6}). Las fuentes no dan tope en mL; no superes el volumen de adulto.": "⚠ Discrepancy: {0} to {1} mL/kg (GAP {2}) versus {3} to {4} mL/kg (RCH {5}, Versiti {6}). The sources give no cap in mL; do not exceed the adult volume.", "Crioprecipitado": "Cryoprecipitate", "{0} unidad cada {1} kg": "{0} unit per {1} kg", "{0} unidades": "{0} units", "Fibrinógeno menor de {0} mg/dL.": "Fibrinogen below {0} mg/dL.", "Von Willebrand si no hay concentrado.": "Von Willebrand disease if no concentrate is available.", "⚠ Discrepancia: la GAP {0} no da dosis. {1} a {2} mL/kg (RCH {3}) frente a {4} unidad de {5} a {6} mL cada {7} kg (Versiti {8}). Fibrinógeno menor de {9} mg/dL (GAP {10}) frente a {11} mg/dL con sangrado (Versiti {12}). Unidades redondeadas hacia arriba.": "⚠ Discrepancy: GAP {0} gives no dose. {1} to {2} mL/kg (RCH {3}) versus {4} unit of {5} to {6} mL per {7} kg (Versiti {8}). Fibrinogen below {9} mg/dL (GAP {10}) versus {11} mg/dL with bleeding (Versiti {12}). Units rounded up.", "Irradiado y leucorreducido": "Irradiated and leukoreduced", "Irradiado: inmunodeficiencia congénita, candidato a trasplante de progenitores, donante familiar, plaquetas HLA, Hodgkin, análogos de purina. Riesgo moderado: leucemia, pretérmino, exanguinotransfusión, cirugía cardiovascular, trasplante de órgano sólido.": "Irradiated: congenital immunodeficiency, stem cell transplant candidate, family donor, HLA-selected platelets, Hodgkin disease, purine analogs. Moderate risk: leukemia, preterm infant, exchange transfusion, cardiovascular surgery, solid organ transplant.", "Leucorreducido: {0} o más reacciones febriles, soporte prolongado, prevención de CMV en inmunocomprometidos y lactantes.": "Leukoreduced: {0} or more febrile reactions, prolonged support, CMV prevention in immunocompromised patients and infants.", "Cardiocirugía en menores de {0} año: glóbulos rojos de hasta {1} días, irradiados y leucorreducidos.": "Cardiac surgery under {0} year: red cells up to {1} days old, irradiated and leukoreduced.", "Dosis redondeadas: verificá siempre las dosis con la guía y el criterio clínico. Confirmá con hemoterapia. Solo glóbulos rojos tiene tope de velocidad en las fuentes.": "Rounded doses: always verify doses against the guideline and clinical judgment. Confirm with the blood bank. Only red cells have a rate cap in the sources.", "GAP {0} Garrahan, Uso de Transfusiones en Pediatría; RCH Blood product prescription {1}; Versiti/BCW Pediatric Transfusion Guidelines {2}; TAXI {3}; Surviving Sepsis Campaign niños {4}. Adicional: no figura en ARUCIP.": "GAP {0} Garrahan, Transfusion use in pediatrics; RCH Blood product prescription {1}; Versiti/BCW Pediatric Transfusion Guidelines {2}; TAXI {3}; Surviving Sepsis Campaign children {4}. Additional: not in ARUCIP.", "Nuevo en Más › Multisistémico: Transfusiones por peso, con volumen, velocidad y umbrales de glóbulos rojos, plaquetas, plasma y crioprecipitado.": "New in More › Multisystem: Transfusions by weight, with volume, rate and thresholds for red cells, platelets, plasma and cryoprecipitate."});
